{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a text adventure about becoming a father! Get up, take care of your child, buy groceries, prepare dinner. Do nothing else. Repeat every day, because...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... You're a dad!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/7f08fa070ea857233a266dc7ded79098.avif?t=1759561231\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your child. It is your job to make sure he thrives, or at least survives. You can go skating, imaginary monster hunting, or just sleep the day away. The game reacts to your actions, so it really is possible. But should you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(No, you shouldn't. Make good choices, okay?)</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate through all the endings!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family is coming for dinner. So not only do you have to be a dad - you also need to make food. You can make food. It's not that hard. Don't get lost in day dreams, going camping or starting a cat caf\u00e9. If your child starts reading philosophy, nip that in the bud before they get a PhD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Just be a responsible adult, please?)</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/8a2d38f87c508b7692163fe50c14cd92.poster.avif?t=1759561231\" width=490 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/8a2d38f87c508b7692163fe50c14cd92.webm?t=1759561231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/8a2d38f87c508b7692163fe50c14cd92.mp4?t=1759561231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a really small world!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stay in your apartment. But if you need to make dinner, you might want to go to the store. In fact you <i>should</i> do that. Don't get sidetracked. Everything is fine. I trust you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/f37c2614dea1545aa75e3b86c6f7f963.poster.avif?t=1759561231\" width=490 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/f37c2614dea1545aa75e3b86c6f7f963.webm?t=1759561231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/f37c2614dea1545aa75e3b86c6f7f963.mp4?t=1759561231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful art by Liberty Jensen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A  story based on the developer's experience of becoming a dad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non-linear narrative in a sandbox. You go where you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different options based on what you've done in the past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A repeating day where you can collect 30 endings - with each ending you'll discover more about the family</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short play throughs of roughly 3-20 minutes per ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy food, make food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the family dynamic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is fine, nothing is wrong, there's certainly no monster in the fridge <i>(Wait, what?)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet the cat, capture the cat in a ball, fight challengers <i>(No, don't! Just take care of your child!)</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160540?t=1759561231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/8cccf8303ba79eb5e8fe6dd07e91fce6bfa4928e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759561231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/fea54f235dd43174e60923972c7d96091db8f09d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759561231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/fea54f235dd43174e60923972c7d96091db8f09d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759561231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores the relationship between two adults who have just become parents. That can be a challenging time. If you're sensitive about this topic or relationship hardships in general, consider if this game might not be for you."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3226390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a text adventure about becoming a father! Get up, take care of your child, buy groceries, prepare dinner. Do nothing else. Repeat every day, because...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... You're a dad!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160540/extras/7f08fa070ea857233a266dc7ded79098.avif?t=1759561231\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your child. It is your job to make sure he thrives, or at least survives. You can go skating, imaginary monster hunting, or just sleep the day away. The game reacts to your actions, so it really is possible. But should you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(No, you shouldn't. Make good choices